# Loading Screen Integration — Walkthrough

## Changes Made

### 1. [svg.html](file:///c:/Users/HP/Documents/flet_projects/LMS-PYTHON-FLET/app/components/svg.html) — Updated
- Replaced gold/cyan coin animation with **blue spinner** matching project theme
- Colors: `#1a1a1a` background, `#42A5F5` / `#90CAF9` / `#0D47A1` blue accents
- Text changed to `Loading...` + `MORNING STAR COOPERATIVE` subtitle
- Clean spinning ring, orbiting dot, floating particles

### 2. [loading_screen.py](file:///c:/Users/HP/Documents/flet_projects/LMS-PYTHON-FLET/app/components/loading_screen.py) — New
- [create_loading_view(route)](file:///c:/Users/HP/Documents/flet_projects/LMS-PYTHON-FLET/app/components/loading_screen.py#9-111) returns an `ft.View` with:
  - Dual-ring `ProgressRing` spinner (native Flet — works reliably)
  - Star icon in center
  - "MORNING STAR COOPERATIVE" branding + "Loading..." text
  - `#1a1a1a` dark background, blue 200/400 accents

### 3. [main.py](file:///c:/Users/HP/Documents/flet_projects/LMS-PYTHON-FLET/app/main.py) — Modified
- **Loading screen shown** before building every route except `/login`
- Uses `page.run_task()` with `asyncio.sleep(0.3)` so the loading UI renders before the heavy view constructor runs
- Refactored route logic into [_build_view()](file:///c:/Users/HP/Documents/flet_projects/LMS-PYTHON-FLET/app/main.py#21-45) helper for cleaner code

